      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this is a cool idea for alot of things. but would likely require a pretty significant change to the way vrchat handles position data and things like it. i could see it becoming its own update with udon. like a udon combat update so you can detect what part of the body you hit to. like just a whole combat update for udon in general would be nice. i think theres some jank ways to do lag compensation in udon but there not the most performant. a native solution would be nicer",
      "viewerReactions": null
