      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It is clear that the games worked until there was an update. Since then we have had to be annoyed with this extreme delay! Regardless of whether you're playing shooter or catch, the delay has been extremely frustrating ever since. When playing catch, you get caught even if the other person is still 7 meters away. With the shooter, you will be shot down even if you have been in cover for 5 seconds. It's no fun anymore.",
